<title>USA: Diamond Multimedia names Walker CFO.</title>
<headline>Diamond Multimedia names Walker CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diamond Multimedia Systems Inc said Tuesday it appointed James Walker as senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Walker's appointment takes effect December 2.</p>
<p>Previously, Walker spent three years as chief operating officer of Fujitsu Computer Products, Sunnyvale, Calif., and four years as the vice president of finance for its parent company, Fujitsu America, also in Sunnyvale.</p>
<p>Walker replaces Gary Filler, who retired in October.</p>
